**Plan:** branch in [cli.js:14](src/cli.js:14) on a `--json` flag, skip `toTable`.

```js
if (argv.includes('--json')) {
  process.stdout.write(JSON.stringify(buildRows()) + '\n');
} else {
  process.stdout.write(toTable(buildRows()) + '\n');
}
```

One open question. `toTable` drops `owner` and `slow` on purpose. `buildRows()` has all five fields. "Same data" could mean either set.

Want JSON to match the table's four columns, or the full row?
